hw->pctrl = devm_pinctrl_register(&pdev->dev, &mtk_desc, hw);
```
```c
err = pinctrl_enable(hw->pctrl);
```
Reason:
The bug occurs because the `pinctrl` is enabled before all groups and functions are added. This improper sequence means that the `pinctrl_claim_hogs` function cannot work correctly, as the pinctrl is in an uninitialized state when it is expected to be fully configured.

