The fix involves using `devm_pinctrl_register_and_init`, which ensures that the pinctrl is registered and initialized properly before enabling it. This change guarantees that all groups and functions are added before the pinctrl is enabled, allowing `pinctrl_claim_hogs` to function correctly.


